why The Air Totem that lets you place air totems, then a weapon of your choice at 40.

# Call of Air at 30 (Eldrun Stormbreaker in Ironforge -> Veyric Thunderhame
# in the northern hills of Arathi: the Air Totem), then Forever's Alliance
# version of the 33-40 chain against the Razormane ritual, all from Veyric:
# Elemental Aid (Charlga Razorflank in Razorfen Kraul) -> Storm, Earth, and
# Fire (five Twisted Totems of each element from the Badlands, the Swamp of
# Sorrows, Dustwallow Marsh and Desolace) -> Heed My Call (the Ravaging
# Tempest at the steam pools of Thousand Needles) -> The Tempest's Weapons,
# handed to Bath'rah the Windwatcher in Alterac Mountains for the weapon.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (givers, enders, the Twisted
# Totems' droppers, the Ravaging Tempest's spawns, Razorfen Kraul's entrance
# from dungeons.json); Forever's Shaman class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) and quest data
# (quests 94789, 96264, 79358, 96135, 96016)
# for the order and the rewards: Air Totem; 96016 gives the Elementalist's
# Guard and a choice of Lightning's Grasp, Tidebringer's Claw or Rage of the
# Storm.
# Storm, Earth, and Fire (79358) is shared with the Horde chain; the data
# lists Rau Cliffrunner and Veyric as its enders, and its text asks for the
# totems "for Veyric Thunderhame in Arathi Highlands": handed to Veyric.
# Elite and dungeon work: Charlga Razorflank is the last boss of Razorfen
# Kraul (a dungeon), and Forever's quest data marks Heed My Call as an elite quest.
# The Alliance leveling guides leave this out: Veyric sits in Arathi and the
# chain then crosses both continents.
# Drops and levels from Forever's quest notes and npcs.json: Charlga
# (level 33 elite, one spawn), the Twisted Totems' droppers (37-41 troggs,
# 34-39 Lost Ones, 35-38 Mirefin, 36-40 Maraudine; only the Maraudine Scout
# has a rate, 44%), the Eye of the Tempest 53% (96135).
# ASSUMED: the Ravaging Tempest fight needs about three players (the Forever-new chain's quest flags; Forever's data marks Heed My Call a group quest but has no group size or the Tempest's level). In-game check: the Tempest's level and whether a duo manages it.
# Beta capped at 30: nothing past Call of Air was played; it follows the data
# above.

step Eldrun Stormbreaker
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 30 Eldrun Stormbreaker, the shaman trainer in Ironforge, sends you to Veyric Thunderhame in Arathi Highlands. Your level 30 air totems (Grounding, Nature Resistance) need the Air Totem he gives.
  level 30
  accept 94789                                -- Eldrun Stormbreaker

step Veyric Thunderhame
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Veyric Thunderhame camps in the hills just west of Hammerfall, the Horde town in the north-east of Arathi: mind its guards. Fly to Refuge Pointe and head north-east.
  turnin 94789 reward 5178                    -- Veyric Thunderhame: your Air Totem
  accept 96264

step Charlga Razorflank
  zone The Barrens
  tip Razorfen Kraul is a five-player dungeon at the southern edge of the Barrens (the arrow points at its entrance); Charlga Razorflank (level 33 elite) is its last boss. She casts Chain Bolt, Renew on her allies and Purity; the Tattered Note drops only from her.
  collect 274463 quest 96264.1 @42.9,90.2 live -- Tattered Note, from Charlga Razorflank

step Veyric Thunderhame
  zone Arathi Highlands
  turnin 96264                                -- Veyric Thunderhame
  accept 79358

step Twisted Fire Totems
  zone Badlands
  tip Five Twisted Fire Totems. The Stonevault troggs (Skullthumpers, Bonesnappers and Shamans, level 37-41) south of Angor Fortress in the Badlands carry them; the Shamans drop Fire Nova Totems and a Healing Ward, the Bonesnappers run for help when hurt. Respawn about five minutes.
  collect 274044 x5 quest 79358.1                -- Twisted Fire Totem

step Twisted Earth Totems
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Five Twisted Earth Totems. The Lost Ones (murlocs, level 34-39) north and north-east of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows carry them; most run for help when hurt.
  collect 274045 x5 quest 79358.3                -- Twisted Earth Totem

step Twisted Water Totems
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Five Twisted Water Totems. The Mirefin murlocs (level 35-38) north-east of Brackenwall Village in northern Dustwallow Marsh carry them.
  collect 274046 x5 quest 79358.4                -- Twisted Water Totem

step Twisted Air Totems
  zone Desolace
  tip Five Twisted Air Totems. The Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) north and north-east of Shadowprey Village in western Desolace carry them; the Scouts drop one nearly every other kill. Wranglers Net and Disarm, Windchasers heal, Stormers throw Jumping Lightning: pull one at a time. Respawn about five minutes.
  collect 274047 x5 quest 79358.2                -- Twisted Air Totem

step Veyric Thunderhame
  zone Arathi Highlands
  turnin 79358 npc 259023                     -- Veyric Thunderhame
  accept 96135

step The steam pools
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Veyric hands you the Corrupted Totems. Thousand Needles is far: the boat to Theramore and the road west, or fly to Thalanaar on the Feralas border and head east into the canyon. Place the Corrupted Totems at the steam pools north-west of Freewind Post to call the corrupted elementals and then the Ravaging Tempest; Razormane quilboar join the fight while the ritual runs. A group quest: bring at least one or two friends. The Eye of the Tempest drops about every other kill, and every group member can loot it.
  collect 212792 quest 96135.1 group 3        -- Eye of the Tempest, from the Ravaging Tempest

step Veyric Thunderhame
  zone Arathi Highlands
  turnin 96135                                -- Veyric Thunderhame
  accept 96016

step Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Bath'rah camps in the ruins in the east of Alterac Mountains: from Tarren Mill follow the river east of town north into the hills. Pick your weapon: Lightning's Grasp, Tidebringer's Claw or Rage of the Storm.
  turnin 96016 reward 280696 choose 280607 280605 280604 -- Bath'rah the Windwatcher: the Elementalist's Guard and your weapon
